Urgency: medium
Maintainer: fehlix <fehlix@mxlinux.org>
Changed-By: fehlix <fehlix@mxlinux.org>
Description:
 verify-iso-sig - verify the GPG signature of a downloaded ISO image
Changes:
 verify-iso-sig (2026.09.01) mx; urgency=medium
 .
   * Take both personal and system-wide keys into account when
     recognizing a signing key.
   * Recognize a new signing subkey of an already-known key
     automatically.
   * Take key revocation into account more thoroughly, including a
     revoked subkey.
   * Add a way to refresh trusted keys for updates.
   * Add .kbx import support, in addition to .asc and .gpg.
   * Accept fingerprints to list only specific trusted keys.
   * Show more detail about a signing key, including its primary key
     when a subkey signed the ISO.
   * Adjust the key manager's button and column labels.
   * Add mx-gpg-keys to Recommends.
